{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790404361794,"sessionID":"ses_f239c71ebffeg90UozFVOeVXTS","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_tkV1TDwZy8vOQggizscreSoy","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd\n@@\n-var minimum_drag_time_elapsed := false\n+var drag_started_at := 0\n@@\n func enter() -> void:\n-\tminimum_drag_time_elapsed = false\n+\tdrag_started_at = Time.get_ticks_msec()\n \tvar card_layer: Node = card_ui.get_tree().get_first_node_in_group(\"card_layer\")\n \tcard_ui.reparent(card_layer)\n \tcard_ui.global_position = card_ui.get_global_mouse_position() - card_ui.pivot_offset\n \tcard_ui.state_label.text = \"Dragging\"\n-\n-\tawait get_tree().create_timer(DRAG_MINIMUM_THRESHOLD, false).timeout\n-\tminimum_drag_time_elapsed = true\n@@\n \tif event.is_action_pressed(\"right_mouse\"):\n \t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, State.BASE)\n-\telif minimum_drag_time_elapsed and event.is_action_released(\"left_mouse\"):\n+\telif event.is_action_released(\"left_mouse\") and _minimum_drag_time_elapsed():\n \t\ttransition_requested.emit(self, State.RELEASED)\n+\n+\n+func _minimum_drag_time_elapsed() -> bool:\n+\treturn Time.get_ticks_msec() - drag_started_at >= DRAG_MINIMUM_THRESHOLD * 1000.0\n*** Add File: /workspace/drag_mechanic_test.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tcall_deferred(\"run\")\n+\n+\n+func run() -> void:\n+\tvar main = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\troot.add_child(main)\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\n+\tvar rack = main.get_node(\"OverlayUI/Rack\")\n+\tassert(rack.get_child_count() == 3)\n+\tvar card = rack.get_child(1)\n+\tassert(card.card_state_machine.current_state.state == 0)\n+\n+\tvar card_center = card.global_position + card.size / 2.0\n+\t_send_mouse_button(card_center, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tassert(card.card_state_machine.current_state.state == 1)\n+\n+\t_send_mouse_motion(card_center + Vector2(10, -10))\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tassert(card.card_state_machine.current_state.state == 2)\n+\tassert(card.get_parent() == main.get_node(\"OverlayUI\"))\n+\n+\t_send_mouse_button(card_center + Vector2(10, -10), MOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT, true)\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tassert(card.card_state_machine.current_state.state == 0)\n+\tassert(card.get_parent() == rack)\n+\tassert(card.get_index() == 1)\n+\n+\tcard_center = card.global_position + card.size / 2.0\n+\t_send_mouse_button(card_center, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n+\t_send_mouse_motion(Vector2(124, 54))\n+\tawait create_timer(0.1).timeout\n+\tawait physics_frame\n+\tassert(not card.targets.is_empty())\n+\t_send_mouse_button(Vector2(124, 54), MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tassert(not is_instance_valid(card))\n+\tassert(rack.get_child_count() == 2)\n+\n+\tprint(\"drag mechanic integration test passed\")\n+\tquit()\n+\n+\n+func _send_mouse_button(position: Vector2, button: MouseButton, pressed: bool) -> void:\n+\tvar event := InputEventMouseButton.new()\n+\tevent.position = position\n+\tevent.global_position = position\n+\tevent.button_index = button\n+\tevent.pressed = pressed\n+\tInput.parse_input_event(event)\n+\n+\n+func _send_mouse_motion(position: Vector2) -> void:\n+\tvar event := InputEventMouseMotion.new()\n+\tevent.position = position\n+\tevent.global_position = position\n+\tInput.parse_input_event(event)\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd\nA workspace/drag_mechanic_test.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd\n+++ /workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd\n@@ -1,26 +1,27 @@\n extends \"res://scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state